innova2-app (1.3.15) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New: innova2-smi ddr-assess. On a card booted into the DDR tester image,
    loads candidate DDR configurations (lanes, speed, CA drive) as partial
    bitstreams, judges each by full self-checked read/write passes, reloads a
    clean one and re-tests it, and settles on a route-V per-card DDR profile
    (widest clean, then fastest, then CA drive). Prints / writes the profile
    file and the link-config line that carries it. --from-logs settles from
    existing tester campaign logs.
  * ddr / status / check: on route V the measured DDR speed uses the LOADED
    xclbin's MIG variant (POLL_CYC and reference from DDR_INFO), not the
    template's. A DDR4-2400 profile xclbin read 2666 MT/s before.
  * ddr -v: a 'this load' line with the loaded controller's speed, width,
    ECC, CA drive and variant.

