    ecc-baseline). After a warm reboot, UEs whose last one follows the last
    link-down are WARN ddr.ue_stale ("likely stale-data reads after warm
    reboot", hint: contents lost in the link-down MIG reset; re-fill, then
    ecc-baseline, or cold boot); where the shell cannot tell stale from fresh
    it says so (WARN ddr.ue_unclassified). UEs with no link-down since the
    clean point stay FAIL.
